<title>AUSTRALIA: CENTRAL NORSEMAN FULL YEAR PROFIT SLIDES.</title>
<headline>CENTRAL NORSEMAN FULL YEAR PROFIT SLIDES.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     2.67 vs 11.65</p>
<p>    Net					0.99 vs 7.39</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)		nil vs 2.5</p>
<p>    Total dividend (cents)		1.5 vs 4.0</p>
<p>    Sales				   60.77 vs 62.62</p>
<p>    Other income			   4.13 vs 3.78</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			    0.48 vs 3.55</p>
<p>    Abnormal items		  loss 1.10 vs nil</p>
<p>    Tax					0.58 vs 4.26</p>
<p>    Interest (thousands)		  nil vs 4</p>
<p>    Depreciation			  14.83 vs 13.16</p>
<p>    Minorities				nil vs nil</p>
<p>NOTE: Central Norseman Gold Corp Ltd is a gold miner and is 50.48 percent owned by WMC Ltd. The company produced 124,602 ounces of gold in the year at an average cost before abnormals of A$491 per ounce compared to 119,622 ounces in 1995/96 at an average cost of A$450 per ounce.</p>
<p>-- Melbourne Bureau 61-3 9286-1435</p>
